{
    "_help": [
        "This file feeds the Creature Quiz (index.php?pg=pkmn-quiz).",
        "An entry is either a plain string (\"Adaro\") or an object for extras:",
        "  { \"en\": \"Polar Bear\", \"de\": \"Eisbär\", \"aliases\": [\"bear\"], \"sprite\": \"custom_name\" }",
        "Every language name and every alias counts as a correct guess.",
        "Guess matching ignores case, spaces and punctuation.",
        "The file name prefix (before the first '-') decides where sprites come from:",
        "  harmontide-*.json -> the real creature art in images/creatures/",
        "  any other prefix, e.g. pkmn-*.json -> images/games/<prefix>/<en name, lowercased, only a-z0-9>.png",
        "  e.g. \"Will-o-Wisp\" in pkmn-gen.json -> images/games/pkmn/willowisp.png. Use \"sprite\" to override.",
        "Sprites are shown at 50x50.",
        "Copy this file, change categories/entries, and it appears in the settings dropdown."
    ],
